== Living architecture ==

Architecture changes should update implementation, canonical BITwiki standards, nearby repository READMEs, <code>manifest.json</code> and executable validation where each is relevant. READMEs provide local repository orientation; BITwiki pages carry deeper project semantics. Historical archive evidence is preserved rather than rewritten to match the present.

